/T (CoinGate is a Lithuanian-based fintech and crypto payments company founded in 2014, specializing in cryptocurrency payment processing and gateway services. Its platform enables merchants to accept Bitcoin, stablecoins, and other digital assets, and offers conversion services to fiat to protect against volatility. Businesses can integrate CoinGate via APIs and popular e-commerce plugins to streamline crypto payments globally.)
/E (CoinGate is a Lithuanian-based fintech and crypto payments company founded in 2014, specializing in cryptocurrency payment processing and gateway services. Its platform enables merchants to accept Bitcoin, stablecoins, and other digital assets, and offers conversion services to fiat to protect against volatility. Businesses can integrate CoinGate via APIs and popular e-commerce plugins to streamline crypto payments globally.)
